WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.705 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.908
-Come on, Kyle.
Our sketch was due an hour ago.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.409
We need to turn it in now.

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:13.779
-No, it needs to be perfect.
I've got to keep writing.

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:15.114
-But we'll get in trouble.

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:16.615
They don't like it
when it's turned in late.

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.284
-I don't care
what anyone thinks.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.052
I'm going to keep on writing
and I don't need to

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:22.655
listen to you,
you jealous [bleep]

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.226
-Hi. It's Jake Gyllenhaal.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.560
Where's your sketch, Mooney?

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.130
-You say something to me
[bleep]?

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.364
-Arrgghh!

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:40.440
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.974
-Drugs?

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:43.710
Are you addicted?

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.010
-So what, Donnie Dorko?

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.311
I need them to write.

00:00:46.311 --> 00:00:48.648
Ah, no, what am I saying?

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.217
I have so many problems
and secrets.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.553
-Well, we're here to listen,
Kyle.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:56.889
-Yes, we want to know more about
your life and how you got here.

00:00:56.889 --> 00:01:01.861
-Okay. Guess it's time for me
to get serious.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:08.868 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:15.641 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:18.678 line:0%
Hey, Kyle Mooney here
and I can't wait to take you

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:21.947 line:0%
behind the scenes of my new
weekly segment for "SNL,"

00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:23.716 line:0%
"Serious Night Live."

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:31.157 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:32.625 line:0%
I don't care what anyone thinks.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.493 line:0%
I'm going to keep on writing
and I don't need to

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.729 line:0%
listen to you,
you jealous [bleep]

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.399 line:0%
So, yeah, that was a fun one.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:42.235 line:0%
I love dramatic shows and movies
and I love "SNL,"

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.502 line:0%
and I'm like,
"Can we combine them?"

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:45.238
That's never been done, right?

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.139
Let's go behind the scenes,
come on.

00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:50.776
So "Serious Night Live" is the
new dramatic non-comedy series

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:52.712
I'm going to be doing every week
at the show.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.847
-They don't like it
when it's turned in late.

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:56.516
-Yes! Great.

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:59.252
Sort of an A24 meets
Safdie brothers vibe.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:00.753 line:0%
Kind of scary, kind of sexy.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.989 line:0%
But I knew I just had
to nail it.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:06.726
Alright, Mikey reading for the
role of Mikey. Let's hear it.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:08.661
-Hey, Kyle, what are you
working on?

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.430
-That's a choice.

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:13.766
We'll be in touch, man.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.368
-Okay.

00:02:16.902 --> 00:02:19.939
-Might want to stick to
sketch comedy, bud.

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:23.276
So, yeah, the show tackles
current "SNL" drama.

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:27.146
But just like "Godfather 2,"
we also get to see Kyle's rise

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:33.152
to get here, his troubled past
growing up as a kid named Kyle.

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.620
I'll just play the kid.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.889
Looking like an Irishman me
or something. Jesus.

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:40.293
But first we had to get the
thumbs-up from the big man.

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:41.828
Hey, Lorne.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:44.364
"Serious Night Live,"
what do we think?

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:46.532
-Kyle, get out of my office.

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:49.868
-Lorne. Very biting wit.

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:53.839
So unlike normal sketches,
I had to pay about $85,000

00:02:53.839 --> 00:02:55.875
of my own money --
the crew, the lights.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.844
Had to pay for
the de-aging effects,

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.311
which turned out great.

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:00.546 line:0%
-Let's make a video!

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:02.248 line:0%
-Plus the drugs were
actually real.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:03.916 line:0%
And that was really expensive.

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:06.519
And the guys who sold them to me
sort of wanted to stick around.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:08.788
Didn't love that,
but it's "Serious Night Live"

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:13.025
and we got Jake Gyllenhaal and
he totally brought his A-game.

00:03:13.025 --> 00:03:14.627
-Whoa.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:16.028
-Kyle.

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:19.832 line:0%
-Kyle offered me $40,000 cash
to act in this thing

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.534
and said it was
a legitimate crew.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:24.337
I said yes 'cause I --
I don't know. I felt bad.

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:25.772
I don't really know the guy.

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:28.207
He's not really on the show
that much, right?

00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:30.877
That's got to be tough.
-Chillin' like a Gyllenhaal.

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:33.178
Dude, great shoot.
You want to get drinks later?

00:03:33.178 --> 00:03:36.515
-Oh, sorry, dude, I got to
rehearse for the show now.

00:03:36.515 --> 00:03:39.018
-No worries.
Happy to drink alone.

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.887
Hey, any word if I'm in sketches
this week?

00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:44.356
Sort of got F'd over
last Saturday.

00:03:44.356 --> 00:03:46.091
-Uh, uh...

00:03:46.091 --> 00:03:47.993
[ Telephone rings ]

00:03:47.993 --> 00:03:50.929
-Well, that's a wrap on
"Serious Night Live."

00:03:50.929 --> 00:03:52.165
I hope you enjoyed it.

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:54.066
I did spend a lot of money.

00:03:54.066 --> 00:03:55.735
Obviously I'm almost 40.

00:03:55.735 --> 00:04:00.139
And if -- if this doesn't take
off in a -- in a really big way,

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:04.643
there's probably no reason
for me to be in show business.

00:04:04.643 --> 00:04:07.247
Or -- Or maybe even alive.

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:12.652
So...please just [bleep] tweet
about it.

